{"id":"f7902ce45af1aeee","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/550_解释性逻辑_ILM.md","title":"550 解释性逻辑 ILM","display":"550_解释性逻辑_ILM","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad \\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad \\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是语言内部的派生式。再令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\">\\(\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\">\\(A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B\">\\(A\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{550}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{550})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{550}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{550})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{550}(B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。本语言无绑定，并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{550}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{550}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{550}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{550}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,550}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,550}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{550}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{550})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{550}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{550})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{550}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{550}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A)\\triangleright\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,A)\\triangleright\\operatorname{Sub}_{550}(\\sigma,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{550}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{550}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{550}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{550}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{550}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{550}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{550}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{550}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{550}\n=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{550}\n=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{550}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{550}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{550}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to((A\\lor B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{550}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to((A\\lor B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{550}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(\\Diamond A\\to\\Diamond B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{550}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(\\Diamond A\\to\\Diamond B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{550}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Montagna 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{550}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to((A\\land\\Box C)\\triangleright(B\\land\\Box C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{550}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to((A\\land\\Box C)\\triangleright(B\\land\\Box C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{550}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{550}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{550}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{550}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{550}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{550}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{550}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{550}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{550}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{550}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示形式、载体类型与总关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{550}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{550}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Nec 只能用于空依赖较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{550}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{550}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列四项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{550}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{550}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{550}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{550}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{550}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{550}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{550}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{550}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{550}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{550}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{550}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{550}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{550}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{550}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{550}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{550}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{550}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"IL\">\\(IL\\)</span> 加 Montagna 公理族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{550}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{550}\\)</span>。该公理显式把解释性公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\triangleright B\">\\(A\\triangleright B\\)</span> 与派生盒式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C:=(\\neg C)\\triangleright\\bot\">\\(\\Box C:=(\\neg C)\\triangleright\\bot\\)</span> 组合，因此不是第 549 条的改名副本。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ILM}_{550}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{550},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{550},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{550},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,550},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{550},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{550},\n\\vdash_{550},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{550}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ILM}_{550}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{550},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{550},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{550},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,550},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{550},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{550},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{550},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{550},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{550},\n\\vdash_{550},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{550}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含解释性框架语义或算术解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{550}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad \\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B),","d